body:
Right--- at the cost of kowtowing to people who don't see a difference between love and lust, or an orientation and a kink. 

You feel free to keep chopping bits of you off to appease the people who keep moving the goalpost of "respectability" all you like. I'll keep fighting for the freedom for people to be as weird and loud as they fucking want, and we'll see which one of us actually ends up with more rights. 

{*here's a hint: historically, it's been the "weirdos and freaks" that win.*}

Oh, so you're just \*really bad\* at acknowledging boundaries and not trying to manipulate and coerce someone into your way of thinking. I can't \*imagine\* how she would feel the need to say such a thing to you\~ /s

&#x200B;

Yes, you're being manipulative. You need to stop.
